#: schema goalnexa.TemplateMetric.snap_to
msgid "Inherited (the default): its goal's setting - a sub-metric's, its parent metric's. Any time: each check-in keeps its own time. Daily/weekly/...: each check-in moves to the latest moment at or before it, whoever checks in. Every team's copy follows it."
